WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:02.360
So...

00:02.360 --> 00:03.980
what's your name?

00:03.980 --> 00:07.440
If you need a name to call me by,
just call me "Saber."

00:07.440 --> 00:08.650
Saber, you say?

00:09.450 --> 00:11.780
That's quite a classy name.

00:12.200 --> 00:16.450
That sword you had...
Which drugstore did you find it in?

00:14.160 --> 00:16.450
If what Francesca told us is correct...

00:16.830 --> 00:19.160
that guy would be King Arthur.

00:20.290 --> 00:24.340
But he said he swears to Arthur Pendragon?

00:24.340 --> 00:25.130
Yes.

00:25.710 --> 00:28.970
Swearing to oneself is a strange tale indeed.

00:29.340 --> 00:31.300
What about the girl
that seems to be the Master?

00:31.680 --> 00:34.550
She is honestly answering
the questions we ask.

00:35.430 --> 00:37.600
However, she is quite fatigued...

00:38.430 --> 00:42.020
and it seems she has muddled memories
due to hypnotic Magecraft.

00:42.520 --> 00:45.900
Other than the tattoos engraved onto her body
similar to Command Spells,

00:46.230 --> 00:48.650
she is basically an ordinary citizen.

00:48.650 --> 00:51.860
If this girl took the right
to be a Master for herself,

00:51.860 --> 00:54.490
she must be quite a skilled Mage.

00:54.910 --> 01:00.620
Perhaps one that was hastily prepared
and sent by an external faction?

01:01.160 --> 01:03.040
The Einzberns, huh?

01:03.580 --> 01:08.420
There is intel that one of their homunculi
has entered Snowfield.

01:08.920 --> 01:11.510
If so, there is a possibility...

01:11.510 --> 01:14.760
that she hasn't had
much information shared with her.

01:16.180 --> 01:19.850
Don't let surveillance drop
from the girl or the Servant.

01:20.520 --> 01:22.940
And, don't forget surveillance on Caster.

01:23.600 --> 01:27.860
We had a request from Sir Caster earlier.
He said, "Let me play in the casino."

01:24.810 --> 01:27.860
<i>Come on, man!</i>

01:28.230 --> 01:31.400
Denied. It'd be asinine
to have a Heroic Spirit...

01:31.400 --> 01:34.490
galavanting around a casino
during a Holy Grail War.

01:34.820 --> 01:36.620
All-in on red.

03:13.460 --> 03:14.550
I'm sorry!

03:17.880 --> 03:24.720
A woman who seeks to use me should not cower
before anyone other than me, Tiné Chelc.

03:25.020 --> 03:25.850
Y-Yes.

03:26.350 --> 03:29.060
I am terribly sorry, Sir Gilgamesh.

03:29.940 --> 03:35.610
So, this is the location where people and fortune
come and go the most in this city?

03:36.990 --> 03:37.900
Not bad.

03:37.900 --> 03:40.700
I don't believe this!

03:38.910 --> 03:45.370
This amusement center uses currency
to create its own world for extravagant spending.

03:45.370 --> 03:47.290
World, you say?

03:47.910 --> 03:49.330
I thought I told you.

03:49.870 --> 03:55.050
A child should act as a child
and take in the sights with their eyes shining.

03:56.210 --> 04:00.510
Though, everything about this world
must pale in comparison to me.

04:02.430 --> 04:04.430
Exactly as you say.

04:04.930 --> 04:07.230
But do not have blind faith in me.

04:07.560 --> 04:09.230
If your eyes should shine as such,

04:09.230 --> 04:13.270
you should also use them
to properly ascertain your path.

04:13.730 --> 04:15.150
Which way will you go?

04:15.860 --> 04:19.900
Is regaining this land from those Mages
a decision you have made...

04:20.570 --> 04:23.120
or merely the words of a puppet?

04:23.660 --> 04:26.080
I-I am...

04:27.580 --> 04:29.160
Ah, well.

04:30.000 --> 04:35.290
So long as my friend is present, I intend
to fully enjoy myself in this Holy Grail War.

04:35.630 --> 04:41.510
If you wish to wield me as a Servant
of your own free will...

04:41.510 --> 04:45.430
be prepared to bare
all of what you keep within yourself.

04:46.720 --> 04:47.720
Yes.

04:50.100 --> 04:51.980
All-in on black.

04:51.980 --> 04:54.110
I'll go all-in on black, too.

04:57.020 --> 05:00.280
I just wanted to borrow some of your luck.

05:00.280 --> 05:03.280
Gotta get started on the right track
since I have a big job after this.

05:09.410 --> 05:10.710
Thanks.

05:10.710 --> 05:12.670
I've stocked up on some luck thanks to you.

05:13.290 --> 05:17.000
I'll return this fortune to your garden later...

05:17.000 --> 05:18.460
King Gilgamesh.

05:19.510 --> 05:22.590
No need to be so alarmed, young lady.

05:22.590 --> 05:23.800
I see.

05:23.800 --> 05:26.050
You're no ordinary mongrel.

05:26.430 --> 05:27.600
Introduce yourself.

05:27.970 --> 05:30.020
Hansa Cervantes.

05:30.020 --> 05:32.560
I'll be supervising this Holy Grail War.

05:32.890 --> 05:34.350
Pleasure to meet you.

05:34.980 --> 05:36.860
Don't get carried away, you hear?

05:37.400 --> 05:39.980
Indeed, I was getting carried away.

05:40.360 --> 05:45.410
Truly, my spirit soared at being called upon
to such a magnificent stage.

05:45.700 --> 05:51.160
You got carried away and killed a man,
then destroyed the Opera House?

05:51.160 --> 05:53.370
I did not murder that man.

05:53.370 --> 05:58.090
What you need to do is research how much
the repairs on the Opera House shall cost.

05:58.420 --> 06:00.800
If you will let me know, I will reimburse you.

06:01.170 --> 06:05.430
You're telling me a madman like you
has some means to pay the money?

06:05.430 --> 06:08.890
I mean, you can invest in me
as my patron if you'd like.

06:08.890 --> 06:10.520
I'd never forget my gratitude.

06:10.520 --> 06:11.560
I've had enough—

06:11.560 --> 06:13.230
I wouldn't say for free, of course.

06:13.230 --> 06:15.390
I can show you a magic trick.

06:15.730 --> 06:17.810
It's amazing! You'll be surprised!

06:18.150 --> 06:19.400
Huh?

06:19.900 --> 06:21.110
I will now...

06:22.190 --> 06:23.740
disappear.

06:23.740 --> 06:24.610
Huh?

06:26.530 --> 06:27.530
He's gone!

06:30.620 --> 06:31.660
Freeze!

06:31.660 --> 06:33.250
Don't move!

06:33.250 --> 06:35.120
I have not moved one step.

06:35.670 --> 06:38.420
Of course, if I wanted to, I could have fled...

06:38.420 --> 06:40.840
or taken care of you all easily.

06:41.670 --> 06:45.380
This is my way of demonstrating
my respect for you.

06:45.380 --> 06:47.050
Respect, you say?

06:47.800 --> 06:50.300
I do not intend to stay in your custody.

06:50.300 --> 06:55.640
I only came to prove
that the girl over there is innocent.

06:57.650 --> 07:00.150
I will disappear with the dawn.

07:00.150 --> 07:02.900
Until then, I will comply with your restraints.

07:03.230 --> 07:07.280
Well, it'd be in your best interest to come up
with an excuse for how you let me escape.

07:09.780 --> 07:12.580
If anything, I can help you guys think of one.

07:13.200 --> 07:17.920
It seems he hasn't even a thought
of concealing the Holy Grail War.

07:17.920 --> 07:21.290
Take care of the memories
of the three inside through hypnosis.

07:21.290 --> 07:22.710
Understood.

07:23.170 --> 07:25.170
Chief, you have a visitor.

07:25.760 --> 07:26.720
Who is it?

07:26.720 --> 07:30.970
Well, he's claiming to be a priest from the Church.

07:33.560 --> 07:36.180
<i>Are you a tourist? Where are you from?</i>

07:36.680 --> 07:38.480
<i>Can I assume you're Japanese?</i>

07:38.480 --> 07:40.150
<i>You'd better not be lying.</i>

07:40.150 --> 07:42.570
<i>What did you come here for?</i>

07:54.580 --> 07:55.580
I'm sick of all of this.

07:58.620 --> 08:00.710
You look rather fatigued.

08:02.790 --> 08:04.500
Don't be so surprised.

08:04.500 --> 08:06.800
In my Spiritual Form,
I can walk through walls.

08:07.260 --> 08:12.050
The interrogation is on a break right now,
so I came by to see how you were doing.

08:13.050 --> 08:15.430
I thought I told you
to not meddle in my affairs.

08:16.310 --> 08:18.430
You're not my Master, though, right?

08:18.850 --> 08:20.140
That's right.

08:20.140 --> 08:22.440
I'm not your Master or anything.

08:22.940 --> 08:26.400
That means I do not have to abide
by your orders!

08:26.400 --> 08:27.190
Wha...

08:27.530 --> 08:31.240
Which means, I can meddle with you
to my heart's content!

08:31.240 --> 08:33.700
I will be taking care of you,
so brace yourself, okay?

08:34.080 --> 08:37.160
I'm begging you, please leave me alone.

08:37.620 --> 08:39.870
I don't want to be in a Holy Grail War.

08:40.250 --> 08:41.210
Unfortunately, that may not work out.

08:43.750 --> 08:47.130
I think it's because of the spell
planted within your tattoo...

08:47.550 --> 08:50.510
but it seems a Magical Energy path...

08:50.840 --> 08:54.300
has been connected with you instead of the Mage
that originally had the Command Spells.

08:54.300 --> 08:55.100
Huh?

08:55.100 --> 08:58.600
In other words, we may not be
in a Master-Servant relationship,

08:58.600 --> 09:02.270
but we do share the same fate.

09:02.730 --> 09:04.060
What's with that?

09:04.060 --> 09:05.860
She didn't say anything about that—

09:07.280 --> 09:12.030
Without you, I cannot gain Magical Energy,
so I would have disappeared immediately.

09:12.360 --> 09:13.660
I feel indebted to you.

09:13.660 --> 09:14.620
Thank you.

09:15.160 --> 09:17.370
If you feel indebted,
don't get involved with me.

09:17.370 --> 09:19.000
I decline!

09:19.000 --> 09:20.200
I will look after you!

09:20.200 --> 09:21.710
I will become a venerable busybody!

09:21.710 --> 09:24.630
Cry all you wish in defiance,
but I will save you in myriad ways!

09:24.630 --> 09:26.790
Save me... from what?

09:27.040 --> 09:29.210
The other war participants, of course.

09:29.210 --> 09:29.840
Huh?

09:30.260 --> 09:31.590
As I said, I'm not a Master—

09:31.590 --> 09:33.630
Whether you are a Master or not...

09:33.970 --> 09:36.430
as long as we are connected
through a path of Magical Energy,

09:36.430 --> 09:38.560
you will naturally become a target.

09:39.680 --> 09:41.350
This is the worst.

09:41.850 --> 09:43.350
Not necessarily.

09:43.350 --> 09:46.480
You're better off like this than being captured
by the enemy and executed, right?

09:46.770 --> 09:48.320
You sure go to extremes.

09:48.610 --> 09:50.070
I hear that a lot.

09:50.440 --> 09:53.490
For now, you can call me "Saber."

09:53.490 --> 09:54.660
HE'S HOPELESS...

09:55.160 --> 09:58.240
I feel ashamed to not name myself
to my benefactor.

09:58.240 --> 10:00.870
But I will tell you my True Name in due time
when I see the right opportunity.

10:01.450 --> 10:03.330
Can you let me know, as well?

10:03.330 --> 10:05.170
Why were you in such a location?

10:05.790 --> 10:07.460
What is that tattoo—

10:08.210 --> 10:09.380
No.

10:10.000 --> 10:10.960
I'm terribly sorry.

10:11.300 --> 10:14.430
You should tell me your name first!

10:16.970 --> 10:19.100
Are you Chief Orlando Reeve?

10:19.600 --> 10:20.720
And you are?

10:20.720 --> 10:22.600
Hansa Cervantes.

10:22.600 --> 10:26.520
I am the Overseer dispatched
to Snowfield Central Church.

10:27.060 --> 10:30.400
You understand if I phrase it that way,
don't you, Chief?

10:30.400 --> 10:32.030
I have no idea what you're talking about.

10:33.190 --> 10:39.160
If you're going to feign innocence despite the barrier
you put up all around the police station, that's fine.

10:39.160 --> 10:43.620
It just means there will be no place for you
to escape to after losing your Servant.

10:43.620 --> 10:45.370
That means less work for me,
so it'd be a great help to me.

10:47.170 --> 10:51.630
I already know that you're a rogue
who has nothing to do with the Clock Tower.

10:51.630 --> 10:53.420
On top of that,

10:53.420 --> 10:59.140
you've collected about 30 unnatural personnel
within the police organization.

11:00.850 --> 11:04.310
You're quite something
to have dug up all of that information.

11:04.640 --> 11:08.520
It seems you lot have already failed
at keeping the ritual a secret.

11:09.110 --> 11:12.230
So, is that Servant and his Master here now?

11:12.900 --> 11:14.740
What if I said they were?

11:14.740 --> 11:18.360
They are participants in the Holy Grail War
that the Church has no information about.

11:18.860 --> 11:21.370
If possible, I'd like to get over the greetings now.

11:22.910 --> 11:24.250
Fine.

11:24.250 --> 11:26.870
In any case, this isn't something
to talk about here.

11:26.870 --> 11:27.960
Come with me.

11:28.500 --> 11:30.130
I'll pass.

11:30.130 --> 11:33.670
I have no intention of jumping into the bowels
of a group still shrouded in mystery.

11:34.380 --> 11:37.340
I will acknowledge that caution...

11:37.840 --> 11:42.430
but had you not thought that this lobby
would already be within my bowels?

11:45.890 --> 11:47.560
Magecraft to clear out a crowd...

11:48.230 --> 11:50.810
How much does the Church know right now?

11:51.400 --> 11:53.150
You have no right to remain silent.

11:53.610 --> 11:56.530
Your statements will never be brought to court.

11:57.190 --> 11:59.950
I think you've watched
a few too many police dramas, Chief.

12:00.530 --> 12:03.370
It's not wise to make the Church your enemy.

12:03.870 --> 12:07.000
I assume I may be no match against you lot,

12:07.000 --> 12:11.290
but bullying someone like me will put a crack
in the relationship between the organizations.

12:12.040 --> 12:16.630
Agreed. I would prefer
the amicable sharing of information.

12:17.260 --> 12:20.510
Don't be threatening a good Samaritan.

12:20.510 --> 12:23.350
I will scream and cry.

12:34.480 --> 12:36.320
<i>Hey, Brother!</i>

12:36.320 --> 12:38.820
Caster? How do you know this number—

12:38.820 --> 12:41.200
<i>You'd better flee
from there right away, Brother.</i>

12:41.200 --> 12:42.030
<i>Either that...</i>

12:42.490 --> 12:45.280
<i>or prepare to return fire at full strength!</i>

12:45.280 --> 12:46.200
What?

12:46.200 --> 12:49.120
<i>Somethin' real bad is heading to ya!</i>

12:51.620 --> 12:53.130
Your allies?

12:53.830 --> 12:57.630
My allies would enter
from the front or back door...

12:58.880 --> 13:00.970
not from the sky.

13:09.560 --> 13:11.980
They even took out the emergency power supply.

13:11.980 --> 13:13.940
Setting up spells for light sources.

13:19.990 --> 13:23.240
Was that your Servant just now, Chief?

13:23.570 --> 13:24.320
Damn you!

13:24.820 --> 13:26.910
You're overstepping your role as Overseer!

13:27.490 --> 13:33.540
Call it humble resistance against an authority
that has threatened a weak, ordinary citizen.

13:41.970 --> 13:43.760
What was that sound?

13:43.760 --> 13:44.890
Not sure.

13:44.890 --> 13:47.640
It seems like someone unleashed
a Noble Phantasm.

13:50.390 --> 13:52.100
You can use magic, too?

13:52.640 --> 13:55.020
Not magic. Magecraft.

13:55.020 --> 13:57.610
I don't understand the difference.

13:57.610 --> 14:00.900
To begin with,
this isn't something that I created.

14:01.240 --> 14:03.070
Oh, hold on!

14:07.450 --> 14:08.370
Ayaka...

14:08.700 --> 14:11.250
First and foremost,
I'm going to take you to a safe location.

14:12.080 --> 14:15.170
Isn't this cell the safest place?

14:15.170 --> 14:16.630
We'll see about that.

14:16.630 --> 14:20.420
It seems there are barriers
set up all over this police station.

14:20.420 --> 14:21.920
"It seems"?

14:22.550 --> 14:26.140
I don't understand what's going on.
Is there a Mage in the police station?

14:26.140 --> 14:27.430
Likely so.

14:27.430 --> 14:32.100
If that vibration was another Servant attacking...

14:33.140 --> 14:34.480
Come now.

14:34.480 --> 14:36.480
You should tell me things like that first.

14:36.480 --> 14:39.440
If that were the case, I would've sliced
the door open and left immediately.

14:39.440 --> 14:41.440
Wh-Who are you talking to?

14:41.440 --> 14:42.860
Oh, sorry!

14:42.860 --> 14:44.740
Just consider it as if I'm talking to myself.

14:45.360 --> 14:47.700
On the ceiling of the cell we were just in...

14:48.160 --> 14:52.450
there was a spell set up that could kill
the person inside from hypoxia.

14:55.410 --> 14:56.710
Servant...

15:11.310 --> 15:13.890
Don't jump in yet! We'll block
the escape path! To your positions!

15:16.230 --> 15:18.270
They're all... Noble Phantasms?

15:18.900 --> 15:20.610
You're surprised?

15:20.610 --> 15:23.610
If the standard formula
is for Servants to wield Noble Phantasms...

15:24.030 --> 15:27.200
it's the job of an author to destroy that formula.

15:28.070 --> 15:30.530
All general staff have been evacuated.

15:30.530 --> 15:32.740
A bounded field has been activated...

15:32.740 --> 15:34.700
to conceal at least some of the commotion.

15:38.920 --> 15:40.790
<i>Skirt the night shadows...</i>

15:40.540 --> 15:40.790
SKIRT THE NIGHT SHADOWS

15:40.790 --> 15:42.000
<i>Zabaniya.</i>

15:54.930 --> 15:55.930
Is that...

15:56.310 --> 15:57.520
Assassin?

15:58.190 --> 15:59.440
If so...

15:59.440 --> 16:02.320
I couldn't ask for more for a touchstone!

16:02.820 --> 16:04.030
Do not fear!

16:04.030 --> 16:05.400
I don't care if you destroy the lobby!

16:06.150 --> 16:08.200
We will suppress her at all costs!

16:14.200 --> 16:15.790
Powers of a heretic...

16:18.580 --> 16:19.670
<i>Expose the mirage...</i>

16:20.000 --> 16:20.250
EXPOSE THE MIRAGE

16:20.500 --> 16:22.000
<i>Zabaniya!</i>

16:23.670 --> 16:24.460
What did you...

16:31.800 --> 16:33.760
They're making the Magic Circuits go haywire?

16:33.760 --> 16:35.140
Chief! Behind you!

16:36.640 --> 16:37.890
<i>Zabaniya!</i>

16:40.060 --> 16:41.690
They have multiple Noble Phantasms, too?

16:41.730 --> 16:43.360
<i>Overflow with agony...</i>

16:43.690 --> 16:44.940
<i>Zabaniya!</i>

16:47.860 --> 16:49.030
Chief!

16:55.160 --> 16:56.240
Are you all right?

16:56.910 --> 16:57.790
Yeah.

17:01.790 --> 17:03.130
Surprising.

17:03.540 --> 17:07.000
Your Master must have
quite the stock of Magical Energy.

17:07.590 --> 17:09.550
I have no Master.

17:10.260 --> 17:10.930
What?

17:11.380 --> 17:13.550
I have no intention of serving a Mage, either.

17:13.550 --> 17:15.390
I seek not the Holy Grail.

17:15.760 --> 17:21.940
I will break apart the Holy Grail War
that has led astray my great predecessors!

17:22.400 --> 17:23.940
That's nonsense.

17:23.940 --> 17:26.980
You should be long gone
fighting like that...

17:26.980 --> 17:29.650
with no supply of Magical Energy.

17:32.660 --> 17:35.620
Oh, marvelous! Just marvelous!

17:35.620 --> 17:38.830
This mud-slinging brawl is much to my liking!

17:40.620 --> 17:42.580
I don't know what kind of spellwork this is,

17:42.580 --> 17:48.050
but I had thought you were overreaching,
challenging a Heroic Spirit as a mortal.

17:48.050 --> 17:51.760
Yet it actually looks
like you're a pretty good match!

17:51.760 --> 17:52.680
Who are you?

17:53.180 --> 17:58.850
If there is even one Mage among you capable of
determining the characteristics of her Noble Phantasm,

17:58.850 --> 18:02.730
you police may yet gain a chance of victory!

18:02.730 --> 18:03.440
Stay where you are!

18:03.440 --> 18:05.190
However...

18:05.560 --> 18:11.780
I can't have you lot fight a good fight
and die off honorably.

18:14.660 --> 18:15.360
John!

18:16.740 --> 18:18.080
What a great scream!

18:18.080 --> 18:23.500
I wonder, if I rip off his other hand,
will his show of pain be even better?

18:23.500 --> 18:24.750
That's enough!

18:28.040 --> 18:30.800
Cease your squealing. How disgusting.

18:40.890 --> 18:44.980
Definitely a masterpiece,
worthy of being called a "Noble Phantasm."

18:44.980 --> 18:47.150
A toy too good for human hands.

18:50.820 --> 18:52.610
I haven't introduced myself!

18:52.900 --> 18:55.280
O my beloved!

18:56.240 --> 18:59.280
My name is Jester Karture.

18:59.280 --> 19:02.200
As your Master, I will affirm
everything about you...

19:02.870 --> 19:05.330
and as an inhuman Dead Apostle...

19:04.080 --> 19:04.830
DEAD APOSTLE

19:05.330 --> 19:07.880
I will take everything from you.

19:08.880 --> 19:10.090
A Dead Apostle?

19:11.420 --> 19:14.090
A Dead Apostle? We have a Dead Apostle!

19:14.090 --> 19:16.300
A vampire? Seriously?

19:16.300 --> 19:19.390
This is getting even more interesting!

19:19.390 --> 19:20.430
Though...

19:20.890 --> 19:24.230
this is a bit bad for my brothers.

19:24.810 --> 19:25.770
Impossible!

19:26.270 --> 19:27.690
Back there, Master...

19:29.310 --> 19:37.490
This heart still remembers the feeling
of your palm! Like that of an intense kiss!

19:39.370 --> 19:44.040
It literally took hold of my heart!

19:44.040 --> 19:48.330
I've received Magical Energy
from a monster like this?

19:50.000 --> 19:51.590
Dead Apostle...

19:51.590 --> 19:52.960
The enemy...

19:52.960 --> 19:53.920
of humanity!

19:57.550 --> 19:59.300
I order you with a Command Spell.

20:01.220 --> 20:05.850
Transport to a location
as far away from this city as possible.

20:13.650 --> 20:15.150
The baton has been passed.

20:15.650 --> 20:17.450
Well, how do I put this...

20:18.360 --> 20:21.870
Why don't you just die already,
you bags of blood?

20:21.870 --> 20:23.450
<i>Clan Calatin!</i>

20:26.080 --> 20:27.160
Don't get me wrong.

20:27.830 --> 20:31.080
It's not like I'm more powerful
than a Heroic Spirit.

20:31.420 --> 20:35.590
After all, a Heroic Spirit
is something that affirms human history.

20:35.590 --> 20:38.760
It protects the rules of the human world.

20:39.840 --> 20:43.550
However, we Dead Apostles deny human history.

20:44.390 --> 20:48.230
We've existed in violation of all your rules.

20:49.850 --> 20:51.270
It is simply an issue of compatibility.

20:53.560 --> 20:54.480
Of course...

20:54.860 --> 20:59.780
it'd be a different story, even with the same Noble
Phantasm, if a Servant were the one wielding it.

21:02.320 --> 21:05.030
Do you know what all of you are lacking?

21:05.990 --> 21:06.990
Power?

21:08.410 --> 21:10.080
Invaluableness.

21:10.080 --> 21:14.420
You lot have not one bit of faith
in a higher being.

21:14.840 --> 21:17.210
Not in gods, not even in Heroic Spirits.

21:17.210 --> 21:21.510
On top of that, you don't even believe
in your own power.

21:21.510 --> 21:23.590
That's why you want to rely on tools.

21:24.260 --> 21:26.930
There is no invaluableness in that.

21:27.970 --> 21:31.060
I cannot teach you
the concept of invaluableness...

21:31.060 --> 21:33.230
but I can teach you evanescence.

21:33.770 --> 21:36.650
Now, I will take this, not even a weapon,

21:36.650 --> 21:42.200
and I'll crush the head of this so-called Chief
that all of you put your trust in.

21:50.660 --> 21:54.290
Are you going to at the very least
fight back as a human?

21:54.630 --> 21:57.000
What useless resolve.

21:57.000 --> 22:00.460
Not one thing will reach me.

22:02.260 --> 22:05.180
Not one thing will reach you, huh?

22:06.260 --> 22:08.140
My coffee got you...

22:08.140 --> 22:09.930
EPISODE 2

22:08.140 --> 22:09.930
didn't it?
